  "details": "Find a world link in game, click it. It won't open in game, but rather in the quest browser. There you'll find avatar and world links don't work.\n\nHow hard is it, in game to resolve the links and connect? See the following example...\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_5dc3ee23-ec06-46c1-b7e9-d42aca5405a9\n\nand when clicked in quest, give the option to go to\n\nvrchat://launch?ref=vrchat.com&id=wrld_5dc3ee23-ec06-46c1-b7e9-d42aca5405a9&attach=1\n\nasvthe quest browser doesn't handle the vrchat: protocol, rewrite to a world link.",
